WEBVTT

00:15.900 --> 00:18.500
How long has it been since 
I've done laundry?

00:19.920 --> 00:25.090
Izuku Midoriya is trying to take 
on the burden of his power,

00:25.090 --> 00:28.220
but he still has a lot to learn.

00:28.220 --> 00:30.530
He's just a normal high schooler!

00:31.220 --> 00:32.430
Please...

00:32.960 --> 00:34.640
let this place...

00:34.640 --> 00:37.930
continue to be his hero academia!

00:41.570 --> 00:44.890
I'm... back...

00:49.890 --> 00:52.350
Don't be too stubborn.

00:52.690 --> 00:55.640
There are times when you need 
to kill someone to save them.

00:57.050 --> 00:59.570
Don't forget that.

01:00.610 --> 01:03.660
It might be that the only way 
to stop him is to kill him.

01:03.990 --> 01:07.320
I don't know what I should 
do specifically yet, but...

01:08.400 --> 01:10.640
I want to save that kid.

01:12.910 --> 01:15.050
The final battle is approaching...

01:16.640 --> 01:19.570
But strangely, I don't feel afraid.

01:24.820 --> 01:26.820
We'll get it back together.

01:34.890 --> 01:41.200
Overcome despair, and go 
beyond--to the future.

03:31.960 --> 03:35.020
I am here in Japan's largest city, Tokyo.

03:35.630 --> 03:38.530
As you can see, the city 
is basically shut down.

03:38.930 --> 03:42.570
It appears other cities 
are in a similar state.

03:43.120 --> 03:46.000
The criminal group who brought about this 
unprecedented devastation to Japan

03:46.000 --> 03:48.590
calls themselves the Paranormal 
Liberation Front.

03:49.300 --> 03:53.330
Their leaders are the infamous All For 
One, also known as the Symbol of Evil

03:53.330 --> 03:57.050
and the one expected to be his 
successor, Tomura Shigaraki.

03:57.750 --> 04:03.220
They have released inmates one after another 
from prisons all over the country,

04:03.220 --> 04:08.220
and these villains called "jailbreakers" 
have only been causing more destruction.

04:08.750 --> 04:14.220
Japan's heroes are working with the police 
to recapture these jailbreakers,

04:14.760 --> 04:17.230
but they are being overwhelmed in numbers.

04:17.230 --> 04:21.650
Because of this, the Japanese government 
has requested the temporary dispatch of--

04:22.130 --> 04:24.140
What the hell are you doin'?

04:24.140 --> 04:28.940
I-I'm just here to report the current 
situation in this country--

04:28.940 --> 04:32.020
Outsiders can't just do what they want!

04:30.720 --> 04:32.020
Stop...

04:32.020 --> 04:35.630
Having fun watching someone 
else's problem?!

04:36.200 --> 04:37.490
Bastard!

04:37.490 --> 04:39.730
Ethan, do we have orders to attack?

04:39.730 --> 04:41.090
Not yet.

04:41.090 --> 04:46.180
The incident in Japan made villains in 
countries around the world more active.

04:46.770 --> 04:51.380
I'm sure it's hard for the White House 
to act with our own country in danger.

04:51.380 --> 04:52.660
Damn it!

04:52.660 --> 04:57.440
Even though it'd only take us about 
two hours to bring heroes to Japan!

04:57.440 --> 04:58.520
In that case...

05:01.720 --> 05:04.910
Will you take me, bros?

05:05.510 --> 05:06.620
Star...

05:10.900 --> 05:13.660
Don't blame us if you get in trouble, Star!

05:13.660 --> 05:15.890
I'll be going either way.

05:15.890 --> 05:18.170
It's just a matter of sooner or later.

05:18.540 --> 05:22.290
Besides, it's a direct 
request from All Might.

05:22.630 --> 05:24.650
My master's in trouble!

05:24.650 --> 05:27.650
There's no reason for me to think twice!

05:29.050 --> 05:33.060
In the Nick of Time! A Big-Time Maverick from the West!

05:35.160 --> 05:37.730
This is a critical moment.

05:38.530 --> 05:42.790
It's thanks to the jailbreakers going 
wild to their hearts' content.

05:42.790 --> 05:46.330
The police and the heroes have 
their hands full stopping them

05:46.330 --> 05:49.270
and can't devote their full forces to us.

05:49.600 --> 05:54.800
We can beat them at hide-and-seek 
on this small island nation.

05:55.600 --> 05:57.790
We could've beat them if we 
left the country, too.

05:57.790 --> 06:00.900
Well, the conditions are different.

06:00.900 --> 06:04.300
Beating them at hide-and-seek 
is a short-term goal.

06:04.580 --> 06:09.430
Taking possession of One For 
All is a medium-term goal.

06:09.430 --> 06:11.700
That's not your ultimate goal?

06:11.700 --> 06:15.860
I've got a long plan for my life.

06:15.860 --> 06:23.440
And now, the biggest hurdle of that 
plan--and the biggest chance--is coming.

06:25.030 --> 06:29.580
I have many friends all 
over the world, you see.

06:29.580 --> 06:34.360
In Japan, All Might eradicated 
organized crime,

06:34.360 --> 06:37.770
but that's not the case overseas.

06:37.770 --> 06:41.750
If I have them run riot, 
it'll become necessary

06:41.750 --> 06:44.970
for each country to weigh their options 
of helping themselves or others.

06:45.620 --> 06:47.660
What do you mean by a hurdle and a chance?

06:47.660 --> 06:50.000
Star and Stripe.

06:50.510 --> 06:52.820
The strongest woman.

06:52.820 --> 06:58.540
The hero who reigns at the top of the land 
of the free, the birthplace of heroes!

06:58.540 --> 07:01.270
Petty tricks don't mean anything to her.

07:01.740 --> 07:03.980
It's a gamble!

07:03.980 --> 07:07.530
Having that intervene will 
be worse than a pain.

07:08.180 --> 07:13.430
But if I can steal her Quirk, then 
the battle will be as good as won.

07:14.370 --> 07:16.330
Now, Iguchi.

07:16.860 --> 07:21.990
Unlike Toya and the others, you 
seem devoted to guarding me,

07:21.990 --> 07:24.500
but it's time you made a move, too.

07:25.030 --> 07:31.880
From now on, you will support Tomura 
Shigaraki's fight, Spinner!

07:31.880 --> 07:35.600
Like that name, you spin things together.

07:35.600 --> 07:37.690
You were nobody.

07:37.690 --> 07:41.480
As a heteromorph, you had a tough life.

07:41.480 --> 07:43.280
You can already hear it, can't you?

07:43.280 --> 07:47.980
There are many who sympathize 
with you in the shadows.

07:45.730 --> 07:52.150
Liberate the Paranormal

07:52.150 --> 07:55.780
Spinner is a spokesperson

07:56.130 --> 07:58.740
Because of the abominable old regime,

07:58.740 --> 08:02.340
Re-Destro was captured.

08:02.340 --> 08:04.340
But look!

08:04.340 --> 08:07.300
Our hopes are not completely dashed!

08:07.300 --> 08:11.080
The embers of liberation are still burning!

08:11.420 --> 08:14.830
We are part of the Vanguard 
Action Support Regiment...

08:14.830 --> 08:19.900
We were put in Spinner's regiment 
because we were like him.

08:19.900 --> 08:24.390
The only unhurt leader, the 
great Skeptic, said...

08:25.290 --> 08:27.020
Liberate yourselves.

08:27.420 --> 08:30.560
Clean up the vestiges of the old regime

08:30.560 --> 08:34.110
and realize Re-Destro's revolution.

08:34.110 --> 08:40.600
Gather warriors in the way 
easiest for you all!

08:42.270 --> 08:44.490
I don't like them,

08:44.490 --> 08:47.880
but I must do what the 
circumstances call for.

08:44.500 --> 08:47.880
Himiko Toga's tragedy continues!

08:48.210 --> 08:51.860
Re-Destro found hope in those guys.

08:51.860 --> 08:53.350
It doesn't matter if

08:53.350 --> 08:57.900
the League of Villains will bear the 
responsibilities of true liberators or not.

08:57.900 --> 08:59.330
Worship them!

08:59.330 --> 09:02.650
We will make them into the real thing!

09:02.890 --> 09:05.650
In the future where Tomura 
Shigaraki destroys...

09:05.650 --> 09:08.400
...we will be the ones planting 
the seeds of new growth!

09:13.700 --> 09:16.370
They will enter our airspace soon.

09:18.180 --> 09:21.670
Once we meet up, we should start 
planning our strategy right away.

09:21.670 --> 09:25.390
Anyway, it's really reassuring 
to have her here,

09:25.390 --> 09:27.780
but with Star be okay after this?

09:28.090 --> 09:30.830
It's because she's like that 
that we will be saved.

09:30.830 --> 09:32.680
I have wanted to talk to her

09:32.680 --> 09:38.090
about the precious vintage denim from 
the Gold Rush for a long time.

09:38.630 --> 09:39.800
This is Tsukauchi!

09:39.800 --> 09:41.200
Endeavor! Hawks!

09:41.200 --> 09:42.090
Can you hear me?

09:42.090 --> 09:43.580
We just received a report!

09:43.580 --> 09:46.340
In their flight path, 50 kilometers 
from the landing point!

09:46.340 --> 09:48.580
It's him! He's shown himself!

10:03.330 --> 10:05.470
Such a warm welcome already?

10:05.950 --> 10:07.570
You're a free spirit.

10:10.180 --> 10:13.120
Are you the villain called All For One?

10:15.220 --> 10:16.510
Who knows?

10:17.700 --> 10:21.360
What... am I...?

10:33.230 --> 10:36.060
So that's All For One...

10:36.060 --> 10:37.810
No, Star.

10:37.810 --> 10:40.080
That's Tomura Shigaraki.

10:40.540 --> 10:44.390
According to our intel, he can destroy 
things just by touching them.

10:44.390 --> 10:48.860
He also has super strength, regenerative 
abilities, and can use EMP attacks.

10:49.420 --> 10:51.620
All aircraft, disengage autopilot!

10:51.990 --> 10:53.730
Deploy your anti-pulse fields!

10:54.490 --> 10:56.370
Roger that, Bravo leader.

10:56.370 --> 10:58.440
Anti-pulse field, deployed!

11:03.120 --> 11:04.370
I'll ask just in case.

11:04.370 --> 11:06.200
Engage? Or evade?

11:06.640 --> 11:08.010
Of course...

11:08.690 --> 11:09.890
Smash!

11:10.150 --> 11:11.600
Okay, Star.

11:11.600 --> 11:14.400
I hope at least one plane can land safely.

11:14.400 --> 11:15.810
Battle formation!

11:17.600 --> 11:19.530
All aircraft, Formation Delta!

11:19.530 --> 11:21.780
Roger that, Bravo leader.

11:22.100 --> 11:24.910
Now, let's get that villain!

11:25.210 --> 11:28.870
I'll make sure to bring your 
remains back to your families!

11:28.870 --> 11:31.670
So you can fight without reserve!

11:35.430 --> 11:37.060
It's a strange feeling...

11:37.860 --> 11:41.690
I can assert that I am Tomura Shigaraki.

11:42.490 --> 11:44.040
At the same time...

11:44.040 --> 11:47.170
There's no doubt that I'm me, either...

11:47.610 --> 11:50.200
I've felt like this ever since I woke up.

11:50.690 --> 11:54.910
Radio Waves plus Air Cannon 
plus Heavy Payload.

11:55.890 --> 11:56.860
Get away!

12:01.660 --> 12:04.020
I know what your Quirk is.

12:04.020 --> 12:07.850
It's a matter of who touches 
who first, America!

12:07.850 --> 12:10.030
Even if you know what hand I've got,

12:10.030 --> 12:13.850
making it so you can't counter it 
is what makes me the best, boy!

12:14.760 --> 12:15.920
"Air."

12:15.920 --> 12:22.170
"From now on, the air in the space 100 
meters in front of me will cease to exist"!

12:28.370 --> 12:30.580
Then die with this!

12:30.720 --> 12:39.730
Star and Stripe / Quirk: New Order

12:31.140 --> 12:34.680
Star and Stripe. Quirk: New Order.

12:34.680 --> 12:39.720
After touching something, by calling out 
its name, she can give it new rules!

12:40.020 --> 12:42.610
In this case, she touched the air

12:42.610 --> 12:46.240
and gave it the new rule that 
it would cease to exist

12:46.240 --> 12:48.710
to create a vacuum!

12:49.900 --> 12:52.080
That's a mean Quirk.

12:52.790 --> 12:54.240
I want it!

12:54.600 --> 12:59.360
Well, someone who'd come all the way out 
here to meet me wouldn't die like that.

12:59.970 --> 13:01.170
Laser Cannons!

13:07.450 --> 13:08.770
Locked on target!

13:08.770 --> 13:09.900
Fire!

13:13.450 --> 13:15.670
Yes! I brought him down!

13:15.670 --> 13:18.490
You're an idiot, Wedge! I got him first!

13:18.490 --> 13:19.240
We're not done yet!

13:19.240 --> 13:21.310
Reflect plus Scatter!

13:22.790 --> 13:24.120
"Laser"!

13:26.950 --> 13:30.110
"The laser can be held"!

13:32.410 --> 13:34.590
His body's regenerating...!

13:34.590 --> 13:37.290
That's what Japan lost to!

13:37.630 --> 13:39.750
The vacuum's gone.

13:39.750 --> 13:41.780
Is that one of New Order's limitations?

13:42.510 --> 13:43.610
Should I go for it?

13:45.510 --> 13:48.770
Moving through the air with super 
strength is just what I want to see!

13:48.770 --> 13:50.460
"Tomura Shigaraki"!

13:51.500 --> 13:55.070
I can only set two rules at once.

13:55.070 --> 13:57.810
The first is constantly on myself.

13:57.810 --> 14:01.920
It's impossible to have power as strong 
as All Might's, but even so--!

14:03.670 --> 14:07.200
In the past, I was saved by an 
exchange student from Japan.

14:09.170 --> 14:12.410
My family was on the way 
to Santa Monica Pier.

14:12.970 --> 14:17.420
A robber on the run started 
attacking our car.

14:17.750 --> 14:20.540
I thought, "If I can just 
save my little sister!"

14:20.540 --> 14:22.470
and prepared for death, 
when at that moment--

14:28.750 --> 14:30.260
He was there.

14:32.450 --> 14:34.660
I will never forget those 
two yellow antenna bangs

14:35.520 --> 14:37.980
for the rest of my life.

14:39.380 --> 14:41.370
He became my master!

14:42.250 --> 14:44.990
In order to pay tribute to the 
peace he brought about,

14:44.990 --> 14:48.110
I gave myself eight antenna bangs!

14:48.550 --> 14:53.120
No matter where I go... 
it's always All Might...!

14:53.120 --> 14:56.330
That's why he's called 
the Symbol of Peace.

14:56.810 --> 14:57.860
By the way,

14:57.860 --> 15:01.520
I touched you with that last 
tackle and called your name.

15:02.310 --> 15:06.090
"If Tomura Shigaraki moves 
at all from this place...

15:07.290 --> 15:09.050
...his heart will stop."

15:09.850 --> 15:11.040
She got me!

15:11.790 --> 15:15.550
Ever since I awakened, 
there were indications...

15:16.940 --> 15:20.610
The boundary between us was 
extremely ambiguous...

15:21.550 --> 15:27.810
It should have taken two months of 
recuperation to become "me" completely...

15:27.810 --> 15:30.050
You're amazing, Tomura!

15:30.350 --> 15:33.570
Your hatred! Your destructive urges!

15:33.930 --> 15:38.220
They are growing beyond Doctor 
and my expectations!

15:38.220 --> 15:44.090
In percentages, I'd say 
we are at 97% or 98%!

15:44.090 --> 15:47.420
We will be one soon!

15:47.420 --> 15:51.590
We will be neither All For 
One nor Tomura Shigaraki.

15:51.590 --> 15:55.900
We're melding together into a new person!

15:56.960 --> 15:59.150
No... way...

15:59.970 --> 16:01.290
No!

16:01.290 --> 16:02.300
It's not working?!

16:02.300 --> 16:03.560
Does he have a different name?

16:03.960 --> 16:06.840
Is he not Tomura Shigaraki?

16:06.840 --> 16:10.410
I see! That's fine with me!

16:10.410 --> 16:12.810
Do you hate me? Hate me more!

16:13.120 --> 16:17.200
Your hate will lead to our bright future!

16:17.200 --> 16:18.090
His hair!

16:19.280 --> 16:22.070
It started from that house...

16:22.620 --> 16:27.830
The piling up of each and 
every small resentment!

16:32.230 --> 16:33.830
His hair grew longer?!

16:34.200 --> 16:35.880
I don't get this guy.

16:36.820 --> 16:40.140
I'm starting to understand New Order...

16:40.590 --> 16:43.250
It's super strong, but there are rules.

16:44.210 --> 16:48.540
The number one hero in the 
U.S., Star and Stripe.

16:48.540 --> 16:51.800
Her Quirk is closely guarded by the U.S.,

16:51.800 --> 16:53.930
and no details about it 
have been released.

16:53.930 --> 16:56.380
By touching her target 
and calling its name,

16:56.380 --> 16:58.320
she can impose any rule she wants on it.

16:58.980 --> 17:03.390
It deviates from other Quirks with its 
absurd power that's like child's play.

17:03.390 --> 17:06.880
But, I've figured out some 
things based on our fight.

17:07.540 --> 17:11.250
There's a limit to how much power you 
can add to a living, physical body.

17:12.310 --> 17:13.960
If there were no limit,

17:13.960 --> 17:17.310
then there's no reason she couldn't have 
shattered my skull with her first hit.

17:17.730 --> 17:21.700
"If Tomura Shigaraki moves 
at all from this place...

17:21.700 --> 17:23.570
...his heart will stop."

17:23.970 --> 17:29.020
Based on that rule, there's no 
limit to its weakening effects.

17:29.470 --> 17:35.350
It's like setting a life meter with an 
upper limit to whatever to you want.

17:35.350 --> 17:39.460
On the other hand, since she 
didn't say something like

17:39.460 --> 17:43.560
"Whatever touches this specified 
block of air will die,"

17:43.560 --> 17:46.820
it seems she can't impose a rule 
on something she hasn't touched.

17:47.650 --> 17:51.110
Or, she can but its effect is weaker?

17:51.570 --> 17:56.580
Even so, being able to create a vacuum 
and hold lasers with her rules

17:57.360 --> 18:01.560
means there's a lot of freedom 
with non-living things.

18:02.020 --> 18:04.940
That's the essence of New Order!

18:05.580 --> 18:11.110
The difference between living and 
non-living things must be in the name.

18:11.110 --> 18:14.070
The reason the rule didn't work on me

18:14.070 --> 18:15.560
must be the difference in perception.

18:16.160 --> 18:20.950
Ms. Star thought of me as Tomura 
Shigaraki when she touched me,

18:20.950 --> 18:25.060
But right now, I'm not sure if I'm 
Tomura Shigaraki, or All For One,

18:25.060 --> 18:28.410
or even Tenko Shimura.

18:29.260 --> 18:32.530
When she calls someone with a 
sense of self by their name,

18:32.530 --> 18:35.810
their perceptions have to align.

18:35.810 --> 18:41.150
But it works on objects with no sense of 
self based only on Ms. Star's perception.

18:41.580 --> 18:43.710
Is there a two-target limit?

18:43.710 --> 18:45.760
What's the scope of the power?

18:45.760 --> 18:50.060
Would it work on a dog like Mon 
if she called out "Mon"?

18:50.550 --> 18:53.920
What's gotten into me?

18:53.920 --> 18:55.920
I have this irresistible urge to test it...

18:55.920 --> 18:57.460
It's bugging me.

18:58.390 --> 19:01.920
Looks like he had a countermeasure ready 
for attacks on his respiratory system.

19:01.920 --> 19:03.510
What will you do, Star?

19:03.510 --> 19:06.110
Neither New Order nor the 
concentrated laser attack work

19:06.110 --> 19:07.820
on that regenerating bastard.

19:08.350 --> 19:10.360
Tell Commander Agpar.

19:10.360 --> 19:11.660
Don't tell me...

19:11.660 --> 19:14.980
Acting on your own is bad 
enough, but that's...

19:14.980 --> 19:18.850
If I don't use it here, then what's 
the point of my special authority?

19:18.850 --> 19:21.850
He's not just an enemy of Japan now,

19:21.850 --> 19:23.810
he's an enemy of the world.

19:23.810 --> 19:28.720
We will kill him now, 
in a way Japan can't.

19:29.080 --> 19:34.590
So until we land, give me a 
place to stand, okay, bros?

19:35.620 --> 19:37.020
Jeez...

19:37.300 --> 19:40.220
Taking care of our number 
one's a lot of work.

19:40.220 --> 19:43.100
You guys are with me starting today!

19:43.100 --> 19:45.470
Let's fight together until 
death do us part, brothers!

19:46.040 --> 19:48.590
Wedge! Shake off that 
old rag on top of you!

19:49.020 --> 19:50.670
That spot's for Star!

19:50.670 --> 19:51.910
Roger that!

19:54.240 --> 19:57.760
Just because you get how it works 
doesn't mean you can counter it!

19:58.140 --> 20:03.010
"The air will harden into a shape 
a thousand times my size!"

20:03.620 --> 20:06.920
Fist Bump to the Earth!

20:09.430 --> 20:12.510
I can't see it, but something feels off...

20:18.190 --> 20:20.350
There's no point in accumulating damage.

20:20.350 --> 20:22.370
And if I say, "Tell me your true name!"

20:22.370 --> 20:24.750
There's no way he'd tell me.

20:24.750 --> 20:27.490
In the end, this is the way to beat him!

20:30.130 --> 20:32.720
By crushing him into a million pieces!

20:32.720 --> 20:34.310
But man, he's hard to crush!

20:34.310 --> 20:36.580
Bros, give me your lasers!

20:37.870 --> 20:39.600
"The lasers

20:42.970 --> 20:44.930
will all gather into one!"

20:45.680 --> 20:48.600
United Hyper-Max Output Laser...

20:49.590 --> 20:51.040
Keraunos!

20:52.680 --> 20:55.180
The continuous blast of the max laser!

20:55.180 --> 20:57.440
That's got to burn him to a crisp!

20:57.440 --> 20:59.940
No, it's just keeping 
him from regenerating!

21:00.460 --> 21:01.950
If this was enough to defeat him,

21:01.950 --> 21:04.690
then Endeavor would've been 
able to do it already!

21:04.690 --> 21:05.800
Star.

21:05.800 --> 21:06.820
Commander Agpar!

21:07.140 --> 21:10.720
I'd gotten used to your willfulness 
and let my guard down.

21:10.720 --> 21:14.030
You won't be able to get away with 
just losing your license this time.

21:14.030 --> 21:16.920
That's fine! Is it ready?

21:17.180 --> 21:19.230
I'll give you a shot for free.

21:19.230 --> 21:21.650
And I've already informed Japan.

21:21.650 --> 21:23.020
They'll be there soon.

21:23.020 --> 21:24.840
That's wonderful!

21:25.160 --> 21:31.110
Your willfulness and disregard for rules 
have made our country shine bright.

21:31.380 --> 21:35.360
That villain couldn't even 
be captured by All Might.

21:35.730 --> 21:38.150
It's time for you to surpass him, Cassie.

21:38.900 --> 21:42.640
State-of-the-Art Hypersonic 
Intercontinental Cruise Missiles...

21:43.110 --> 21:44.830
Tiamat.

21:44.830 --> 21:46.770
Get each and every one...

21:46.770 --> 21:47.900
...to hit its mark.

23:20.000 --> 23:22.000
Preview

23:20.510 --> 23:21.990
Here's the preview!

23:21.990 --> 23:26.500
The fight between Star and Stripe and 
Tomura Shigaraki is getting intense.

23:26.840 --> 23:29.140
With the joint assault of 
Star's Quirk, New Order,

23:29.140 --> 23:33.140
and the Intercontinental 
Cruise Missiles: Tiamat,

23:33.140 --> 23:35.150
will they be able to stop evil?

23:36.120 --> 23:39.040
This is a watershed moment for the world.

23:39.470 --> 23:41.570
Next time, "Specter."

23:41.910 --> 23:46.510
That's the strong will of those 
who have inherited the light.

23:45.980 --> 23:49.980
<b>Next time: Specter</b>

23:46.890 --> 23:48.230
Go beyond!

23:48.230 --> 23:49.670
Plus Ultra!
